{"unit_id":"MarchLiu__dsh-cf-sas#readme-1","repo":"MarchLiu/dsh-cf-sas","commit":"43d4bd3175f74885f6296917f1e2412597e614fd","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-security-audit README · dsh-security-audit：[](https://github.com/MarchLiu/dsh-cf-sas/actions/workflows/publish.yml)\n[](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-security-audit)\n\n将 [cloudflare/security-audit-skill](https://github.com/cloudflare/security-audit-skill) 从\n\"prompt 技能 + 手工沙箱\"升级为自治编排的 **DSH plugin**。\n\nUX 目标：**一句话发起 → 面板看进度 → 结束收报告。**\n\n设计文档见 [docs/dsh-plugin-design.md](docs/dsh-plugin-design.md)（已对齐的全部决策记录），\nDSH 插件 API 调研笔记见 [docs/dsh-plugin-api-notes.md](docs/dsh-plugin-api-notes.md)。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-security-audit"}
